Group B Project: Airbnb Business Analysis Using Data Science
Project Overview

The Group B project investigated Airbnb listing-price prediction using a data-science approach.

The group framed Airbnb pricing as a strategic business problem. The purpose was to examine whether listing characteristics could be used to predict price and support improved pricing decisions.

The project included:

exploratory data analysis;
data preprocessing;
train-test splitting;
linear regression;
neural-network regression;
performance evaluation;
permutation importance;
business recommendations.

The group received a baseline mark of 66.

